==Battleground==
*4 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*3 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 43.33~50 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Despite Coffin Zoge's infinite revivals, the stage does not pose major threat as the Zuches spawn incredibly slowly. Simply bringing Holy Blast makes this stage easy with basic labyrinth fodder.

